{"id":"hinter","lemma":"hinter","pos":"prep","rank":283,"glosses":["behind, after","after (in pursuit of)","beyond (further away than)"],"ipa":"/ˈhɪntər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-hinter2.ogg/De-hinter2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wer ist hinter dir her?","en":"Who's after you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700534","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"hither"}]},{"text":"Er stand hinter mir.","en":"He stood behind me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394847","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Darf ich hinter dir sitzen?","en":"May I sit behind you?","words":[{"g":"to be allowed","l":"dürfen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to sit"}]},{"text":"Ich werde gleich hinter dir sein.","en":"I'll be right behind you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789567","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"alike"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Ich hörte eine Stimme hinter mir.","en":"I heard a voice behind me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"voice"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]}]}